        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>SOSS 212, Invisible Door Hinges</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe SOSS 212 is the ultimate security hinge because, when the door is closed, SOSS Invisible Hinges cannot be seen or tampered with. When opened, the riveted hinge pin is non-removable. The installed hinge is firmly anchored in a deep, full mortise, which assists the screws in supporting the door, assuring a stronger door hinge installation. Package includes one (1) hinge with matching finish  #10-24x3/4  wood screws. The 1-1/8 Inch Door Invisible Door Hinge is available in a selection of finish options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/polished-brass-closer-arm.jpg?v=1704354624\" width=\"233\" height=\"313\" border=\"0\" alt=\"SOSS 212 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Invisible Door Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Plate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: <b>1-1/8\" Thick Door</b></li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10-24x3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: High Strength Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SOSS-212-specifications.pdf?v=1704262324\" target=\"new\"><b>SOSS 212 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually (1 Door Hinge)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1-1/8 Inch Door Invisible Door Hinges, SOSS 212",
                "description": "The SOSS 212 is the ultimate security hinge because, when the door is closed, SOSS Invisible Hinges cannot be seen or tampered with. When opened, the riveted hinge pin is non-removable. The installed hinge is firmly anchored in a deep, full mortise, which assists the screws in supporting the door, assuring a stronger door hinge installation. Package includes one (1) hinge with matching finish  #10-24x3/4  wood screws. The 1-1/8 Inch Door Invisible Door Hinge is available in a selection of finish options.",
